  "track.runtime.m.counter.overview": "A counter screen. Tap `+1` and follow the whole path from the handler to the phases. Change the start value and the `Header` parameter kind to see steps 6 and 7 change.",
  "track.runtime.m.counter.wrapup": "Write state → snapshot → invalidate the scope that read it → Recomposer → the Composer re-runs what is needed and skips what is unchanged → the Applier changes structure only when needed → layout and drawing.",
  "track.runtime.m.counter.simp.1": "The eight steps are a teaching split; the real runtime batches, orders and optimises them differently.",
  "track.runtime.m.counter.simp.2": "Counts of recomposed/skipped composables are illustrative for this example.",
  "track.runtime.m.counter.ctl.hint": "Change the start value or the Header parameter.",
  "track.runtime.m.counter.ctl.start": "count starts at",
  "track.runtime.m.counter.ctl.start.n": "{n}",
